ties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHITA ELECTRIC IND CO LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAGUCHI NOBUYOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHITA ELECTRIC INDUSTRIAL CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAGUCHI, NOBUYOSHI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAGUCHI NOBUYOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAGUCHI, NOBUYOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A thermal transfer recording device capable of improving or substantially eliminating at least one of those problems that the recording speed of images is low, stability is low, and cost is high in the recording of lustrous, high quality images, comprising a recording intermediate body riding across a plurality of drums disposed apart from each other so as to form a closed loop, a dyeing layer transfer part having a dyeing layer transfer head opposed to the part of the recording intermediate body on the outer periphery of one of the plurality of drums, an image recording part having at least one image recording head opposed to the part of the recording intermediate body on the outer periphery of one of the drums, and an image transfer part having an image transfer head opposed to the recording intermediate body inside the closed loop.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention porte sur un dispositif d'impression par transfert thermique capable de résoudre ou d'éliminer pratiquement au moins un des problèmes suivants : faible vitesse d'impression des images, stabilité réduite et coût élevé de l'impression d'images brillantes, de haute qualité. Ce dispositif comprend un corps intermédiaire d'impression chevauchant une pluralité de cylindres espacés les uns des autres de façon à former une boucle fermée, une partie de transfert de couche couleur possédant une tête de transfert de couche opposée à la partie du corps intermédiaire d'impression se trouvant sur la périphérie externe d'une pluralité de cylindres, une partie d'impression d'image possédant au moins une tête d'impression opposée à la partir du corps intermédiaire d'enregistrement se trouvant sur la périphérie d'un des cylindres et une partie de transfert d'image possédant une tête de transfert opposée au corps intermédiaire d'impression se trouvant à l'intérieur de la boucle fermée.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>